  grh-ln "        <textarea class='code-ed' id='ed-03' spellcheck='false'>data SB4 : Type where&#10;  sb4 : (x0 x1 x2 x3 : RQ) → SB4&#10;harm4 : SB4 → SB4&#10;harm4 (sb4 f0 f1 f2 f3) = sb4 (rq-div-w (rq-add (rq-add f0 f1) (rq-add f2 f3)) #2) (rq-div-w (rq-add (rq-sub f0 f1) (rq-sub f2 f3)) #2) (rq-div-w (rq-sub (rq-add f0 f1) (rq-add f2 f3)) #2) (rq-div-w (rq-sub (rq-sub f0 f1) (rq-sub f2 f3)) #2)&#10;l2-sq4 : SB4 → RQ&#10;l2-sq4 (sb4 x0 x1 x2 x3) = rq-add (rq-add (rq-mul x0 x0) (rq-mul x1 x1)) (rq-add (rq-mul x2 x2) (rq-mul x3 x3))&#10;sb4-eq : SB4 → SB4 → Bool&#10;sb4-eq (sb4 a0 a1 a2 a3) (sb4 b0 b1 b2 b3) = andB (rq-eq a0 b0) (andB (rq-eq a1 b1) (andB (rq-eq a2 b2) (rq-eq a3 b3)))&#10;in-B0 : SB4 → Bool&#10;in-B0 f = case f of sb4 f0 _ _ _ → case harm4 f of sb4 g0 _ _ _ → andB (rq-eq f0 (rq (rz true #0) #1)) (rq-eq g0 (rq (rz true #0) #1))&#10;duality-ok : SB4 → Bool&#10;duality-ok f = case f of sb4 f0 f1 f2 f3 → case harm4 f of sb4 g0 g1 g2 g3 → andB (rq-eq (rq-add f0 f2) (rq-add g0 g1)) (andB (rq-eq (l2-sq4 f) (l2-sq4 (sb4 g0 g1 g2 g3))) (sb4-eq (harm4 (sb4 g0 g1 g2 g3)) f))&#10;sample-b0 : SB4&#10;sample-b0 = sb4 (rq (rz true #0) #1) (rq (rz true #5) #1) (rq (rz false #2) #1) (rq (rz false #3) #1)&#10;thm-harmonic-duality-and-B0 : andB (duality-ok sample-b0) (andB (in-B0 sample-b0) (in-B0 (harm4 sample-b0))) ≡ true&#10;thm-harmonic-duality-and-B0 = refl</textarea>" (
